<mṛtitatvānusandhāndarśanam>

<436>

<mṛ0 1 pṛ0 1> oṃsvastiśrīgaṇeśāyanamaḥ|| śrībhairavyuvāca śrāvaṃśrāvaṃmahādevalokavistāramuttamam kṛtārthāsmikṛtārthāsmikṛtārthāsminasaṃśayaḥ 
idānīṃśrotumicchāmiyamalokasyavistaram yamalokaḥkathaṃkutrahyadhovāpyurdhvamevavā mṛtaścakutravaiyātijantuḥpāśairvaśīkṛtaḥ kāyovā
līyatekutraśāvosaukāṣṭhasannibhaḥ nirayāḥkatidhāproktāyātanāścatathāvidhāḥ mṛtiṃcaivajanasyāsyavidhiṃtatsamayetathā śāvasnāna
vidhiṃdevacāntyeṣṭimapimevada antyamaṇḍanabhūṣādervidhiṃcāpimaheśvara śavaniḥsaraṇaṃcāpiśmaśānavidhimuttamam kimarthaṃmukha
vasyaṃhi pādavāheviparyayaḥ kimarthaṃ pādatoyajñopavītasyacadhāraṇam kriyāvidhimapīśānadaśāhaṃkarmacaprabho maraṇādeva
bhītānāṃnarāṇāṃvadakāgatiḥ maraṇeca maheśāna hyadbhutāmetvanusmṛtiḥ kṛpayāvadameśambholokānugrahakāmyayā|| śrībhairavaḥ 
nivāritāpideveśigrahilācittacāpalā idaṃrahasyaṃparamaṃnākhyeyaṃyatrakutracit nadātavyaṃśaṭhekrūrebhaktihīnethasundari paraśi
ṣyepideveśisamayācāravarjite parihāsakarevāpivedāgamavinindake mṛtitatvānusmaraṇaṃpretamuktipradāyakam gurubhaktiratānāṃca
vedatantrānusāriṇām sādhūnāṃsamacittānāṃsamayācāradarśinām pariṣatsumaheśāni śrāvyametannasaṃśayaḥ śrotavyaṃparayābhaktyā
hyetadgurumukhātpriye mṛtitatvānusmaraṇaṃpitṛmātṛgurukṣaye prathamaṃdinamārabhyadvādaśāntaṃsamāpayet śravaṇātpaṭhanādvāpimahāpā

<pṛ0 1ba> takanāśanam napramādenaśrotavyaṃ parihāsena vāpunaḥ anyathāvighnadaṃnṝṇāmiti satyena teśape śrutvāpaṭhitvānopaśyennayamaṃnirayāṃstathā 
yamamārgamapīśāni cetyājñāpārameśvarī|| śrībhairavī|| divyantarikṣākāśeūrdhvaṃtiryagathāpivā yamalokaḥkutratiṣṭhedvadasatyaṃmaheśvara|| 
śrībhairavaḥ|| śṛṇudevipravakṣyāmiyāmaṃlokamanuttamam dakṣiṇasyāṃdiśya'vaneradha ūrdhvamapīśvari pātālasyaparaḥproktoyamalokaḥ
sudustaraḥ caturaśītilakṣāṇinarakāścaikaviṃśatiḥ vasantitatradeveśipāpināṃyātanāpradāḥ yamovasatitatraivalokaśāsanatatparaḥ 
citraguptopidevyatrakāyasthānāṃpradhānakaḥ sarvavetyadharaśreṣṭhoyakṣmāvasatinityaśaḥ sarverogāmaheśānicitraguptaniveśane vasanti bhayadā
nṝṇāṃmahāpātakināmapi vyāsādayomaheśānimunayaścordhvaretasaḥ vasantiyāmebhavanedharmādharmavicārakāḥ|| yamaḥproktomahādaṃṣṭro
daṇḍapāṇi'rayomukhaḥ yakṣarākṣasavetālapiśācaparivāritaḥ pāpināṃbhītidonityaṃsādhūnāṃmānavardhanaḥ citraguptastatpurataḥsamaṣīlekhanī
karaḥ karmasaṇṭhī(vahīkhāta) svābhimukhenidhāyacavicārayan likhatepāpināṃkarmasādhūnāṃcaśubhāśubham mṛtasyajantornītasya bhaṭairyamagṛhaṃ
punaḥ pṛthakpatresamālikhyakarmapāpavṛṣātmakam yamāyābhimukhaṃgatvāpatraṃdarśayateśive tatpatremunayaḥsamyagvimṛśyakarmacākhilam 
svargevānirayevāpikrimikīṭapataṅgake tiryagyonā'vapitathāsthāvaratvepisundari tatradeśetatrakāle iyantaṃkālamevavā ayaṃvasatusvaṃkarma
pālayannitipatrake svahastenā'kṣarāṇyuścaira'ṅkayantiyathāvidhi ādāya tatpatramathocitraguptomunibrajāt kārayitvādharmarājahastamuśrāṃ
tatopyadhaḥ 

<mṛ0 2 pṛ0 2a> ājñāpayatirogaṃtaṃmārgeṇānenacānaya samenaviṣamenāpitvaritaṃvābilambitam ānayadhvaṃmahārogāḥpāpinaṃvāpyapātakam|| 
yamagṛhaṃnayantyevaṃ rogārogiṇamīśvari yasyauṣadhairogacayopyapagacchatikaṣṭataḥ dravyāṇāṃsaṅkṣayāttasya prāyaścittamitīritam upapluti
rvivardhetarogagrastasya yasyatu tasyakurvītadeveśi dharmaṃvaipāralaukikam(gocaraṃ) pātheyaṃ śambalaṃdevikuryātputropyatandritaḥ śokarodanamutsṛjya
gāṃraupyaṃsvarṇamevavā vāsāṃsinānāpātrāṇidadyācchaktyānusārataḥ|| svasthaḥsañcayanaṃ tatrapātheyasyakarotiyaḥ sayātisukhasantuṣṭaḥ
yāmemārgesudustare yiyāsutāyāṃ yaḥkaścitpituḥsvasyakarotina antyadānaṃmahādevikeśavārcanapūrvakam sayātinirayāndeviyāva
dindrāścaturdaśa yāniyānicadānānisvayaṃdattānimānavaiḥ tānitānīhasarvāṇihyupatiṣṭhanticāgrataḥ| tataḥsvabāndhavāḥsarveśokaṃtyaktvā
maheśvari viṣṇoḥśivasyanāmānismārayeyuḥpunaḥpunaḥ narokartāraṇādīnistotrāṇi jagadambike paṭheyuḥpāṭhayeyurvāprasthitaṃbhuvaneśvari 
jānauśiraḥsamādadyātputraḥśokasamanvitaḥ yasmācchmaśānaṃdaityānāṃviṣṇunāvihitaṃpurā jānoragretatodeviśiraḥsthāpanamīritam jānva
grasthaṃśirodṛṣṭvāmriyamāṇasyasundari bhūtāḥpretāḥpiśācāścapalāyantediśodaśa tatobrāhmīṃmahāvidyāṃpāṭhayeyuramohitāḥ yatsaṃśrutya
mahāvidyāṃpaśuḥpāśairvimucyate śrutvāpimucyatejanturmahāpātakakoṭibhiḥ|| śrībhairavī|| vadasatyaṃmahādevalokānugrahakāmyayā 
imāṃmahābrahmavidyāṃyāṃśrutvāmucyate paśuḥ jīvanirgamanaṃcāpibhautikādvigrahādvibho kenamārgeṇaniryātivadamehitakāmyayā|| 

<pṛ0 2ba> (hantiavidyāmitihaṃsaḥprāksaṃvitprāṇepariṇatetiśrutyāsaṃvidevaprāṇāpānarūpeṇapariṇatā hakāreṇavahiryātisakāreṇaviśetpunaḥ haṃsahaṃsetihaṃsetijīvojapatinityaśaḥ| śuciṣadaṃ śucideśehṛdayepadaṃniṣaṇṇaṃ vasuṃtejorūpaṃhotāraṃtattadindriyadvārāsarvaviṣayagrāhakaṃ) 
śrībhairavaḥ|| śṛṇudeviparāṃguhyāṃbrahmavidyāmatandritā yāṃśrutvāmucyatejantuḥsadyosaupaśubhāvataḥ| haṃsaṃśuciṣadaṃviṣṇumantarikṣacaraṃ
vasum hotāraṃvedisadanamatithiṃduraṇāsadam(brahmāṇḍāntarvartinaṃ) nṛṣadaṃvarasadanamṛtaṃvyoma(hṛdayākāśebāhyākāśevā)sadaṃtathā abjaṃgojaṃcṛtajamadrijaṃśaraṇaṃsraye tvameva
śuddhastvaṃbuddhonirmalaścatvamevahi (mātṛtolomaloditamāṃsāni pitṛtaḥsnāyvasthimajjāḥ|| ||) ehyehipratyabhijñāṃtvaṃtyajaṣāṭkauśikaṃgṛham yasmātvaṃtrividhairdevatathāmāyā'ṇukārmaṇaiḥ malai
rmalinatāṃyātastasmājjahihivigraham yasmātvaṃpaśutāṃyāto dehapāśavimohitaḥ tasmātvaṃpaśubhāvaṃsvaṃtyaktvāyāhisvabhāvatām 
rāgaḥsphaṭikaratnasyayathāsyādrāgasaṅgataḥ tasmātvaṃpaśubhāvasthaḥpaśutvamadhunājahi mohaṃtyajamahābhāgakāyesmiñjarjaresvayam 
paraṃsvabhāvamātiṣṭhaḥnirmalobuddhatāṃgataḥ jahīhijīrṇāṃtāṃśāvīṃtanuṃpāśavaśīkṛtām svabhāvaṃpariprāptosi māmohaṃkurupañjare tāratrayaṃ(oṃ3) 
vahniyutaṃ(hrīṃ) hakāraṃ(ha) māyāṃ(i) catvaṃjapadevakṣaṇesmin etasmātvaṃmucyasepāśabandhānmohaṃmāgāḥpañjaresminna'satye imāṃmahābrahmavidyāmantakā
lesmarettuyaḥ sayātiśivatāṃdeviyatragatvānaśocate kiṃbahuktenadeveśibrahmavidyāmimāṃsmaran tāṃtāṃsiddhimavāpnotidurlabhāyā
divaukasām yamabhaṅgātyajejjātimalaṃdeviyatonaraḥ brahmavidyāṃcintayatoyamabhītiḥkathaṃbhavet tasmātsarvaprayatnenabrāhmīṃvidyāmimāṃ
paṭhet 

<mṛ 3 pṛ0 3a> śrāvayedvāmaheśāniśivasāyujyatāmiyāt narodanaṃnaśokotraśastovaisurasundari yiyāsoḥsmṛtijananaṃkuryātputraḥsabāndhavaḥ 
putreṇatenabhrātrāvāpitrākiṃvāthabāndhavaiḥ yesmārayeyurnāmānimumūrṣuṃnaśivā'jayoḥ yāvacchvāsobhavettasyatāvadvaismārayecchivam 
śvāsānterodanaṃkāryaṃnijaiḥputraiḥsabāndhavaiḥ hāheticamuhurdeviprakuryātparidevanam āturasyayadāprāṇānayāntivasudhātale dānā
dikaṃtadādeyaṃdvārasyodghāṭanaṃdivaḥ rudrākṣatulasīsragbhiḥkaṇṭhamābhūṣayetpriye rudrākṣasragvinaṃdṛṣṭvāyamadūtāmaheśvari palāyanaparā
sūrṇaṃbhavantigaṇaśaṅkayā|| adhunāśṛṇudeveśidehājjīvasyanirgamam parijñāyacayaṃbhūyonaduḥkhaṃjanmanolabhet antaḥsaṅku
citajñānodaśāṃśritvā'ntikīmaṇuḥ aṅguṣṭhamātraḥpuruṣonirgacchetkāyamadhyataḥ ādāyendriyasaṅghātaṃvāyuvatpuṣpasaurabham paśyantya'ṇuṃ
niḥsarantaṃsūkṣmārthāḥsūkṣmadarśinaḥ| trividhāścanarāḥproktāuttamādhamamadhyamāḥ uttamānāṃbrahmarandhrānmadhyānāmāsyataḥpriye 
adhamānā'mapānenayātijīvomaheśvari prayātaṃpuruṣaṃjñātvāsnānaṃkṛtvāmalā'paham uṣṇairjalairmṛdāvāpidehalepānnivārayet 
tataścavedatantroktaiḥsnānaṃmantraiḥpradāpayet brahmadvāreprāṇavṛtīryathāsyānmṛtakasyaca tadarthaṃpādatoyajñopavītasyacadhāraṇaṃ vastradvayaṃ
parīdhāpyabaddhvāyajñopavītakam gaṅgāprayāgatulasīmṛttikorthaṃviśeṣakam ājanmasañcitaṃpāpaṃharetsadyaḥsurārcite aṅgarāṅgaiśca
tāṃśāvīṃtanumetāṃsuvāsitāṃ chidrā'pidhāpitāṃ

<pṛ0 3ba> kṛtvādhūpairmuktāphalānvitaiḥ pañcaratnairmukhaṃtasyasambalenapūrayet kāṣṭhaloṣṭhasamaṃkāyaṃdṛṣṭvāpretāḥpiśācakāḥ praviśantiyataścidrai
tasmāttatparidhāpanam indriyāṇāṃsthitiryadvatsthirāsyādātmanisphuṭam antarmukhatayādevitadarthaṃmukhavastrakam śivaśakti
svarūpaṃhipratyakṣaṃvaiśarīrakam yathai(?)kyarāyātitadvaipādavāheviparyayaḥ|| saṃbhūṣyatāṃtanuṃmālyairnirhareyurvanaṃtataḥ ghaṇṭārāvaiḥ
śaṅkhaśabdairvādyaiścaharināmabhiḥ yamagāthāḥpragāyadbhirbrāhmaṇaiḥpurataḥkṛtaiḥ dāhayedvanamāsādyacandanaistulasībhavaiḥ 
kāṣṭhairagurusaṃbhūtaiḥśucibhirdevadārubhiḥ vaidikaistāntrikaiścāpimantraiḥsarvatrasaṃkṛtām citāmārohayecchāvaṃ dehaṃvaipūrvatomukhaṃ 
dāhayitvātanuṃśāvīṃruditvābahudhānaraḥ romadāhesametyāthabāndhavaistīrthavaryake tilaistarpaṇamādadyātpretatṛptikaraṃparam 
ādhārabhūtaṃjīvasyajvalanejvalayeccatam niḥśeṣaśca(?)yadagdhavyaḥkiñciddehaṃparityajet evaṃyaḥkurutemokṣaṃtanvāḥsuravarārcite 
sayātiśivasāyujyanityānandamayaṃdhruvam ityevaṃmuktaṃtanumokṣaṇaṃtejantoḥpaśoḥpāśavaśīkṛtasya pitṛkṣayeyaḥśṛṇute
sureśi sabhogamokṣaurlabhatecasiddhim praityaṃcahitvājanako'syadeviprayātisādāśivatāṃ vitāpaḥṣaḍūrmimuktaḥpratiyā
tiśaivaṃpadaṃnacāvṛttimamutrabhūyaḥ|| śītātapauśarīrasyalobhamohetucetasā prāṇasyakṣutpipāśe(?)dveṣa(*****?) 
