<pṛ0 6ba> pūjayedbhojayettuyaḥ sayātiśivasānnidhyaṃyatragatvānaśocate kumbhānsacailānsānnāṃstubrāhmaṇebhyaḥprakalpayet visṛjyabrāhmaṇāndevinama
