dgaraiḥ evaṃbahuvidhābādhāḥprāptāḥpathisudustare brajataḥpretasaṅghātaiḥsahakleśahatasyaca mārgaśramāpanodāyanitya(ntareca) śrāddhaṃcaretuyaḥ sodakumbha
