te tasmānsarvaprayatnenabrahmacārījitendriyaḥ kartāvipraścadeveśijyotiṣṭomaphalaṃlabhet|| śrībhairavī|| kalāvasminmaheśānanakaścidvi
jitendriyaḥ niyameṣu nadārḍhyasthobrahmacaryadharo'thavā asampannatayātenanityaśrāddhasyasubrata tatpitroḥkenasāmyedvaimārgakhedorniduḥsahaḥ| 
deśakālopaplavādvānirdhanatvādathā'pivā kathaṃpretasya sukhado yāmamārgobhavedbhava|| śrībhairavaḥ|| śṛṇuṣvāvahitāprājñepraśnasyāsya
vinirṇayam dvādaśāhaṃsamārabhya yāvatsaṃvatsaraṃbudhaḥ prātarutthāyavidhivatsnānaṃ kṛtvāsureśvari tāmranirmitakumbhenatarpayetpretamanvaham kurukṣetre
prayāgecagaṅgāsāgarasaṅgame kapilānāṃsahasrasyavidhidattasyayatphalam tatphalaṃsamavāpnoti kumbhatarpaṇataḥśive yatrayatravrajetpretoyāmemārge
