saṃśayomemahāñchambhohṛdayevicaratyalam chetuṃtaṃśaktirīśānatvadanyasyakutobhavet daśāhnikekarmaṇiye dīyantepiṇḍasañcayāḥ śarīrasiddhyai
pretasya vrajatomṛtyumārgakam kaiḥkairaṅgānikānī'hajāyantepuṣṭimantitu etadvaktumaśeṣeṇamamāhasijagatpate|| śrībhairavaḥ|| śṛṇusundari
vakṣyāminirṇayaṃhitakāmyayā lokānāṃyatvayāpṛṣṭaṃrahasyaṃ paramādbhutam śirastvādyenapiṇḍenakriyatemriyataḥśive dvitīyenatukarṇākṣināsike
casamāsataḥ grīvā''syabhujavakṣāṃsitṛtīyenayathākramam caturthenacapiṇḍenanābhiliṅgagudānica ūrūjaṅghetathāpādaupañcamenacasarvaśaḥ 
sarvamarmāṇiṣaṣṭhenasaptamenacanāḍayaḥ dantājihvācāṣṭamenavīryaṃcanavamenatu daśamenacapūrṇatvaṃtṛptatākṣudviparyayaḥ evaṃkrameṇadeveśibhautikaṃ
