naukobhirayodantaiḥsamantataḥ ullūkaiścamahāghoraiḥsvabhiścavikaṭānanaiḥ yamadūtaiścadeveśilohadaṃṣṭrairayomukhaiḥ| mahākāyairbabhrunetrairdī
rghajaṅghairbhayānakaiḥ śironetrairjatru(phaharavāy) jihvairvivṛttatārakākṣibhiḥ vamadbhirmukhatovahnimaṭṭhahāsaparāyaṇaiḥ kolāhalenamahatābadhirīkṛta
diṅmukhaiḥ nānāśastrasamāyuktaiḥpāṇivādanatatparaiḥ padāndīrghānprakṣipadbhirbhūmiṃkampayatomuhuḥ jaṅgāgrāhaṃpretagaṇāngabhayadbhirbahu
vyatham itastataḥpreṣitaiścacitraguptenabhāmini vyāptevaṃvidhairdūtairyāmomārgotidāruṇaḥ ghoradhvāntāvṛtobhūrivaiṣamyānugato'bhitaḥ natatra
bhūrisantāpechāyākutrāpiśākhinaḥ kṣaṇaṃviśramyayatraiva jantuḥsukhamavāpnuyāt 

<pṛ0 8ba> tṛṣāvivṛddhaudeveśi nakutrāpijalāśayaḥ kevalaṃdharmevātraśaraṇaṃnanudehinām ṣaḍaśītisahasrāṇiyojanānāṃpramāṇataḥ kathito'yaṃ
mahāmārgodurgamaḥpāpakarmabhiḥ tasmātsarvaprayatnena dharmamevācaredbudhaḥ yasyadharmaḥsahāyovaisasarvatrā'kutobhayaḥ napitānacavābhrātānamitraṃ
nacabāndhavāḥ naputronacavāpautrodhanaṃjāyāgṛhāṇivā pūrayiṣyantideveśitasyapañcapadīmapi ekevaprayātyatrajanturdharmasahāyavān 
mānuṣyaṃ janmacāsādyakhaṇḍesminbhārateśubhe sarvaṃcaivādhruvaṃjñātvādharmamevasamācaret svaḥkāryamadyakurvīta prāhṇikecāparāhnikam bilambo
nātrakāryovaikālojāgartipatrivat yāvatsvāsthyamayodehoyāvannaivendriyakṣayaḥ yāvannajarayādevijarjaraḥpatitaḥkṣitau tāvadevajanaiḥ
kāryamātmarakṣaṇamambike yāvannāyāticayamaḥpāśapāṇirbhayaṅkaraḥ muhyamānasyavaijantorandhasyakaraghātavat tāvadevācarecchreyātmanohitakā
myayā|| yāvatsvasthamidaṃkalevaragṛhaṃyāvatkṣayonāyuṣaḥ yāvaccendriyaśaktirapratihatāyāvaścadūrejarā ātmaśreyasitāvadevaviduṣākāryaḥprayatno
mahānsaṃdīptebhavanepikūpakhananaṃpratyudyamaḥ kīdṛśaḥ|| ititekathitodeviyamamārgobhayaṅkaraḥ pāpināṃsarvadābruhikiṃbhūyaḥśrotumicchasi|| 
śrībhairavī|| śrutvāsudustaraṃmārgaṃyamalokasyaśaṅkara kampatemetanurbhūrivāyuvellitavallivat udbhinnaiḥkaṇṭhakairvyāptābhītāsmiparameśvara sthānāni
