<pṛ0 10ba> grahītāraubhavetāṃpuṇyabhāginau vadanyādātṛrahitamanyathānaśyatejagat etadvakṣumaśeṣeṇakṛpayārhasimeprabho|| śrībhairavaḥ|| śṛṇusundarivakṣyehaṃrahasyaṃparamādbhutam yajjñātvātuma
